SUMMARY:Ballroom Dance with Stardusters!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nNo partner require
 d\, beautiful floor\, lesson included\, friendly dancers. Typical attendan
 ce is 1-2 MeetUp people and 45-60 general public. Plenty of people to meet
  and dance with!\n\nStardusters is a local non-profit that hosts ballroom 
 dances every second Saturday. Join us!\n\n### **-Masks are optional.**\n\n
 * **The CDC says the best way to minimize the chance of covid infection is
  to have circulating fresh air. We will open windows and run fans to get a
 s close to this ideal as we can.**\n* **Admission is $15\, cash or check.*
 *\n* **As always\, we provide a printed playlist of all songs together wit
 h the recommended dance.**\n* General dancing after the lesson will includ
 e all ballroom dances plus selections of Salsa\, Bachata\, Country 2 Step\
 , Night Club 2 Step and West Coast Swing\n* **Water and a small selection 
 of snacks will be provided.**\n* **No partner needed.**\n\n## **The Centur
 y Center 100 North Greensboro Street\, Carrboro\, NC**\n\n**Click here to 
 see a map of recommended parking areas: [Parking Areas](https://www.townof
 carrboro.org/DocumentCenter/View/6718/CC-Color-Parking-Map)**\n\n# **Free 
 Dance Lesson from 7:20-8:15**\n\n# **Ballroom Dancing from 8:15 - 10:40 PM
 **\n\n# **$15 admission**\n\n**Free Refreshments**\n\n## **[Visit and Like
  Us on Facebook](http://www.facebook.com/trianglestardusters.org) https://
 www.facebook.com/trianglestardusters.org**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 5360597/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260621T231256Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260621T231256Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
